( C80 {F4 T6f, 2026-10-16} axisymmetric quad4 -reduced factor 2, column of elements touching the axis r=0: the Professional integrates an element with a node on the axis with the 2x2 Gauss rule even though its reduced points at iso +-0.5 are off the axis; the off-axis elements keep the reduced points. Interior node 5 free. Targets = Professional 02-08-2026 node_dof; GNU before: rc 1, I do not know : -reduced. )

